window.products.push({"id":391315,"name":"Bialetti Moka 6-Cup Replacement Handle","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41j55MGCBVL._AC_SL1009_.jpg","description":"Replace the handle of your espresso machine with this genuine replacement handle from Bialetti. The replacement handle is suitable for Bialetti's 6-cup Moka espresso machine. Includes attachment screw. Please note: the replacement handle does not come with a hole drilled for putting the locking bolt through - you will need to find a method of drilling the hole out. Bialetti is the world's most recognized and beloved Italian coffee company. Bialetti coffee makers have become iconic and has allowed millions of consumers to enjoy great Italian coffee that once was only available in cafes and restaurants. Bialetti's passion remains in making superb coffee simple.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41j55MGCBVL._AC_SL1009_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bialetti","source_asin":"B002B75PPA","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-391315","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B002B75PPA","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B002B75PPA","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":391316,"name":"Statue of Liberty New York Christmas Ornament NYC Christmas Tree Collectible Ornament from Christmas in New York Collection – 3X 2 ½ Inch Double Sided","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Q8rYypheL._AC_SL1223_.jpg","description":"Introducing holiday collection of New York Christmas Ornaments – “Christmas in New York”. It’s no secret that Christmas in New York is celebrated with much more pomp and ceremony than almost anywhere else in the world. This is why Christmas ornaments featuring New York City famous places and landmarks are so popular around the world. Were you raised in Manhattan? Alternatively, have you visited New York during Christmas previously? If so, and want to celebrate the memory of that experience this festive season, we can help. This is because at NY Poster Inc we create beautiful cards and New York themed Christmas ornaments, perfect for seasonal gifting and home decorative purposes. Our New York Christmas ornaments were designed right here in New York’s borough Staten Island, each of our unique Christmas ornaments are designed to help people all around the world celebrate Christmas in New York, no matter how far from the Big Apple they might be. Adorned with award winning photography by Igor Maloratsky, each of our traditional New York Christmas tree ornaments are guaranteed to become a popular talking point between home visitors and family members. Even better, our Christmas in New York ornaments make beautiful gifting pieces in their own right. With NYChristmasGifts, you don’t need to ice skate at the Rockefeller Center or be there in person as snow starts to fall in Central Park this Christmas. Instead, we can help you celebrate New York during Christmas time right in the comfort of your own home. Made with special attention to detail, our NYC Christmas Ornaments, Christmas Tree decorations will add the perfect finishing touches to your home this Christmas. This being the case, order now in order to bring a little piece of New York City into your home this Holidays Season. We are working on new designs to add to our New York Christmas Ornaments collection Happy Holidays from New York City!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Q8rYypheL._AC_SL1223_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"NYChristmasGifts","source_asin":"B09NFJKZJG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-391316","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09NFJKZJG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09NFJKZJG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
