window.products.push({"id":391425,"name":"GKLUCKIN Shag Ultra Soft Area Rug, Fluffy 5'X7' Rainbow Rugs Plush Fuzzy Non-Skid Indoor Faux Fur Rugs Furry Carpets for Living Room Bedroom Nursery K","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A1rMcVfSGzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Ultra-Soft Designed】The GKLUCKIN area rug comes with a velvet feeling surface and a dense sponge layer in the middle that provides high-level coziness as it is very soft to the touch. It's ideal to keep your feet warm from cold hardwood floors or for your kids to lie on it comfortably while playing. Also, a great gift for your family, friends, or lovers at Christmas. 【Higher Density Faux Fur】Feature 1.57-inch-long pile, 450 GSM High-density shag carpet surface, the GKLUCKIN fluffy area rug is incredibly plush and furry. Hardly sheds carpet fibers! This fuzzy area rug provides a rest space for your family to release their body and mind after a busy day. Perfect to decor your rooms. 【Anti-slip bottom】Tiny, durable grip dots on the underside of the area rug are designed to hold up without sliding, even with kids and pets. Plus, it helps to soothe achy muscles and tired feet! The middle foam layer of the rug adds extra cushion under your feet and will redefine your definition of comfort! Ideal for living rooms, bedrooms, nursery, hallway, dorm, etc., without damaging the floor. 【Eco-friendly Materials】Have peace of mind knowing that even in high-trafficked areas of your home, your GKLUCKIN area rug was designed to last for years to come! This extremely soft velvet carpet is made from synthetic material(polyester), and the hypoallergenic property of this area rug makes it perfect for people with sensitive skin or allergies. You can feel free to lay on the carpet areas, barefoot walking, and good for leisure time. Friendly for kids and pets! 【Easy Care】We recommend to vacuum the rug regularly to reduce potential sheds and dust, or you can hand wash the dirty area without worrying about color fade. Since the carpet is covered with a lot of long pile, it's essential to know in advance how fragile it is when you put it in the washing machine. So we don't recommend you do this.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A1rMcVfSGzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GKLUCKIN","source_asin":"B0BV3BZH18","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-391425","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BV3BZH18","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BV3BZH18","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":391426,"name":"Moonshan Manual Liquid Filling Machine Paste Filling Machine Bottle Filler Machine for Cosmetic Oil Lip Gloss Honey Cream Shampoo","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":249.9,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/619W5Z+7gCL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Scale Adjustment & Bottle Platform】The amount adjustment method of this model is upgraded into easy-to-adjust wheel, and there is dual scale display for reference. The adjustable bottle platform can be used for placing bottles with different heights so that there is no need to hold bottles by hand. 【Food Grade & High Temperature Safe】All of the contact material are food grade and high temperature safe than can be used for filling food and high temperature products. The seal ring is made of food grade silicone. The 2.6Gallon(=10kg) hopper is made of SUS304, and the piston is made of PTFE(Teflon) which is resistant to high temperature(392℉), oil, corrosion, and has a good lubricity to reduce the drag effect caused by piston friction, so that to reduce the fatigue. 【Accuracy Up to 1%】Thanks to the simple mechanical structure and all metal inner parts, there is no worry that the machine will broke easily. In addition, the gear and the rod are tightly engaged, and the high load spring rebounds stably to ensure accurate filling every time. 【Strong Spring and Steel Gear Ensure Long Service Life】We upgraded with stronger springs that are more durable and last longer than many other vendors use, use quality steel gear not plastic gear as some vendor do. They are important factors affecting the service life of the manual filling machine. No need to worry that the machine is scrapped after a short period of use. In addition, we provide a TWO-YEAR warranty, life-time technical support, 24-hour response, and US warehouse repair service. 【4mm and 8mm Stainless Steel Nozzle】4mm and 8mm SUS304 filling nozzles are included in the package. Hollow and long design makes it fit for small bottles. There are spare parts for all seals rings for later repair.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/619W5Z+7gCL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Moonshan","source_asin":"B08YCYFGGM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-391426","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08YCYFGGM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08YCYFGGM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
