window.products.push({"id":391464,"name":"Pleasant Home Bath Towels Set - 4 Pack – 32” x 55” | Large Bath Towels | 100% Cotton | 500 GSM | Lightweight, Soft, Absorbent, Durable Towels for Bath","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":38.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A1K8pas8zIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Cotton AFFORDABLE QUALITY – This bulk bundle includes 4 bath towels measuring 32” x 55”. Choose from six striking colors to match your bathroom décor. The elegant Towel set can give a quick freshen up to your master bath or guest bathroom. COZY COTTON: 500 GSM towel with a tight knit weave made of 100% Combed Cotton created for maximum absorbency. The dense weave makes it super soft and snug when you’re drying off after a shower and blissfully wrapping it against your skin. CARE FOR YOUR TOWELS: Wash your towels before the first use to remove any excess lint leftover from the manufacturing process. Always wash your towels separately to avoid transfer of lint onto your garments. Machine wash warm with mild detergent and tumble dry low. We advise against the use of fabric softeners which may reduce absorbency and may cause discoloration. HIGHLY ABSORBENT & QUICK DRYING: The 100% Combed Cotton and dense weave makes these towels extraordinarily absorbent and also allowing for the towels to dry quicker. LONG-LASTING USE – Our towels are machine washable, dryer friendly and made to retain their softness and absorbency for years to come. Our premium towel set is an affordable alternative to Turkish or Egyptian towels.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A1K8pas8zIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"PH Pleasant Home","source_asin":"B08KJ869LM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-391464","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08KJ869LM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08KJ869LM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":391465,"name":"Cocktail Shakers Bar Set 14 Pcs Barware Tool Sets Bartender Kit Stainless Steel Mixing Drink Holder Rack 550ML Martini Boston Mixer w/ Bamboo Base for","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Xgmz5V7OL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Dear ❤❤，it's an honor to meet you.The world is so big, jocabo Cocktail Bar Set may be what you need. Whether you are a beginner or a professional, whether you are at home or in a bar, our Bartender Kit can help you create delicious cocktail or drinks - let you enjoy life and work. ⭐⭐Cocktail Shaker 550ml:  With silver sleek body -- be made of high quality stainless steel ,anti-rust, easy to clean,strong and durability. ⭐⭐Premium Bamboo Stand Base: High quality display stand makes it is easier to storage and remove the cocktail set. ⭐⭐Professional Cocktail Accessories Set: 1* 550ml Cocktail shaker -- Premium 304 SST grade.An advanced filter installed in the shaker will keep ice cubes and fruit chunks from sliding into your drink. 1* Strainer -- Creates a fine straining experience and keeps fruit pulp and ice shards from making their way into your Margarita. 2*Mixing Spoon -- Features a spiral pattern design that gives you a steady, firm grip and makes drink mixing easier than ever. 1*Jigger -- Two-sided 0.5 oz (15ml) / 1 oz (30 ml) to ensure proper balance in your cocktails. 1*Corkscrew -- Elegantly blends the features of a wine corkscrew, bottle opener and foil cutter. 1*Ice tongs -- Perfect grip teeth. Suitable for sugar & ice cubes, lemons, fruits etc. 1*Muddler -- Maximize the true flavors of herbs, spices & fruits. It is perfect for use in cocktails like Mojito, old Fashioned & more. 3* Bottle Pourers -- Fit into most standard-sized alcohol bottles. They are specially designed to avoid spoilt liquids in your bar. 2*Straight Straw -- Drinking straws stainless steel straight straws. Get want you want. ⭐⭐Contact us: If you have any questions with jocabo Cocktail Shaker Set or your order, please feel free to contact us by email. We try our best to provide better products.jocabo always with you！","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Xgmz5V7OL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"jocabo","source_asin":"B08CBQF5B5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-391465","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08CBQF5B5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08CBQF5B5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":391466,"name":"Melange Square 16-Piece Porcelain Dinnerware Set (Black Lines) | Service for 4 | Microwave, Dishwasher & Oven Safe | Dinner Plate, Salad Plate, Soup B","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81gpucaA9nL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"About Melange Melange dinnerware is all about treating you to everyday elegance. We believe fine dinner sets shouldn’t mean fragile dinner sets. We believe every meal should be complemented by dinnerware that makes you smile. That’s why we’ve used premium materials to bring on the durability, special craftsmanship to enhance the longevity, and lovely detailing to catch anyone’s eye. An Everyday Porcelain Dinner Plate Set Designed to Last and Impress Impress your guests, crown that dinner party, or upgrade your everyday dinnerware with an elegant porcelain coupe dinner set that epitomizes durability. We’ve combined high-quality porcelain with a unique chip-resistant design to create a porcelain set that you can use every single day without dealing with constant cracking, flaking, or chipping. - Vitrified at temperatures of over 2480F. - Microwave, oven and dishwasher safe. - 0% porosity for greater durability. - Complete set for service of 4 or 8. - Elegant floral pattern and lovely glaze. Designed to Last We’ve adopted a premium approach to treat you to a dinner plate set that will serve you for years. Not only is the porcelain treated at higher temperatures to make it much stronger but the place sets have special rounded edges that keep chipping at bay, and the high-heat treated porcelain never absorbs any moisture that leads to cracking like others do. For Daily Use No dealing with fragile porcelain dinner sets that you only whip out whenever you have company. Melange dinnerware is strong enough to handle the rigors of daily use. You can safely use it in the microwave, clean it in the dishwasher without breaking, and even use it to reheat food in the oven up to 400F. Everything You Need Every set comes with a dinner plate, salad plate, soup bowl and a mug; everything you need to serve your family or guests a full course meal. Choose between our 16-piece set that comes with 4 of each piece of cutlery and serves 4, or our 32-piece dinner set that comes with 8 of each and serves 8. Understated Elegance Simple yet eye-catching, our range of designs exude an effortless elegance that blends into just about any setting. Beautifully done floral detailing meets lovely colors and a well-done glaze to create porcelain place settings with a premium feel. Get one set for yourself and a couple more as gifts and experience the magic of Melange.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81gpucaA9nL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Melange","source_asin":"B00H1IK4HS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-391466","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00H1IK4HS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00H1IK4HS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
