window.products.push({"id":391499,"name":"Keego Light Filtering Top Down Bottom Up Cordless Window Shades Blinds for Windows-Custom Cut to Size Window Blinds & Shades for Home Kitchen Bedroom ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.9,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61KF3r-uNgS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"LEAD TIME: dispatch in 5-7 working days. 5-7 working days for transportation. Each custom size top/up down cordless window blind is made to order, can't be sold after a return. We appreciate customer precise measures & careful orders, avoid return without quality issues. Keego offers a 1-year warranty on all our products, during which we will repair/replace them free of charge. Please contact us by Amazon message if you have any questions. LIGHT FILTERING SHADES: non-woven polyester fabric is soft and durable while maintaining crisp pleats. The 0.78” single cell construction has a white backing to produce a uniform look from the outside. This light filtering fabric reduces harmful ultraviolet rays from fading furniture and floors and provides privacy while still allowing soft filtered light. This is a great choice for living room, family room, bedroom, bathroom or any room where privacy top down shades are needed. ENERGY SAVING: unique honeycomb construction offers soundproof, while also reducing the harmful effects of ultraviolet rays and providing ideal insulation for energy efficiency. These diffusion fabric shades provide insulation by trapping air between the honeycomb-shaped cells, keeping your home cool in the summer heat, and keeping the warmth secure inside during the winter. SMOOTH & QUIET GLIDE: Keego robust constant force spring-loaded mechanism has passed 5,000 times usual lifting or pulling down tests for each up down cellular blind and makes it easy to raise and lower the cellular shades evenly every time and stay balanced automatically; it retracts and extends smoothly with constant force; our patented spring winder inside prolongs the lifespan of the springs, avoids the rebound or sagging performance and simplifies the mount of the top down bottom up blinds MADE TO ORDER: the cordless light filtering top down bottom up window blinds is custom made, custom width is 16\" to 78\", and height is 10\" to 78\". Inside mount requires 1.5\" minimum window depth, we suggest deduct 0.25\" for install security gap. For outside mount, the width you purchase is exactly the width you get. We suggest adding 4\" to the width and height. Mounting hardware & Install instruction included, very easy to install.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61KF3r-uNgS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Keego","source_asin":"B094ZSCL2M","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-391499","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B094ZSCL2M","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B094ZSCL2M","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
