window.products.push({"id":391544,"name":"Stylish 12 OZ Stainless Steel Vacuum Insulated Tumbler- Thermos cup for keeping coffee, tea and beer HOT/COLD. LEAK PROOF, prevents SPILLS FREE with L","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41y0Q2rfZHL._AC_.jpg","description":"If you’re in the market for a tumbler that can go with you wherever life takes you, then look no further than the 12 oz Stainless Steel Vacuum Insulated Tumbler. This travel mug is perfect for keeping your hot or cold drinks at just the right temperature and comes equipped with an airtight lid to prevent spills. Whether it's coffee, tea, beer or any other beverage of your choice - this tumbler has got you covered! The double-wall insulation design helps keep liquids hot up to 6 hours and cold up to 24 hours without condensation on the outside of your cup. It also features a sweat-proof exterior which prevents water rings from forming on surfaces like wood tables or counters when placed down after use. The stainless steel construction ensures durability so that it won't rust over time even if exposed to moisture regularly (like in humid climates). Plus, its sleek modern look makes it great for both indoor and outdoor use alike! When not in use, simply place the lid back onto your tumbler as an extra precaution against spills while traveling - because let’s face it: accidents happen sometimes! And since all parts are dishwasher safe (excepting only rubber seals) cleaning is quick & easy too – another plus point when dealing with busy lifestyles where time is always short but convenience must still be had somehow… Overall this 12oz stainless steel vacuum insulated tumber provides excellent value thanks to its wide range of features such as spill proof lids; long lasting insulation properties; stylish modern looks; durable construction materials...the list goes on! So why wait? Get yours today & enjoy having delicious beverages ready whenever needed – no matter where life takes you next. Water is the source of life. VACUUM CUP - Enjoy purity every day. Both heat and cold VACUUM DOUBLE DECK DESIGN HIGH THERMAL INSULATION EFFICIENCY HIGH QUALITY STAINLESS STEEL","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41y0Q2rfZHL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Generic","source_asin":"B0BQ7TJLKD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-391544","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BQ7TJLKD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BQ7TJLKD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
