window.products.push({"id":391583,"name":"VHC Brands Teton Star King Sham 21x37 Country Patchwork Design, Navy and Tan","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71XJE+evNoL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"100% Cotton SIZE: The Teton Star King Sham is 21 inches wide by 37 inches long. Shams are sold individually. COUNTRY PATCHWORK DESIGN: Traditional style that compliments any country, rustic, or Americana home. Teton Star features dark khaki tan and navy in a traditional patchwork star and block design. Reverses to solid navy. PREMIUM CONSTRUCTION: Our heirloom-quality pieces are built to last for years to come. Our 100% cotton traditional patchwork sham is expertly crafted in India using a unique yet durable stitch in the ditch and echo hand-quilting technique. Quilted shams offer 100% cotton batting fill. Tie closure. COORDINATES AVAILABLE: Pair this sham with pieces from our entire Teton Star collection for a complete look. Available in quilts and bedding accessories. EASY CARE: machine wash, tumble dry low, iron safe","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71XJE+evNoL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"VHC Brands","source_asin":"B09SGTJZNS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-391583","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09SGTJZNS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09SGTJZNS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
