window.products.push({"id":391605,"name":"ISKM LED Lighted Bathroom Mirror 32x24 Inch Front and Backlit Vanity Mirror for Wall Anti-Fog Mirror with Lights Adjustable 3 Colors White/Warm/Natura","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":179.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81VrSEorpqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"*Backlit+Front-light, Double Light Strip Design*: According to market research, many users are troubled by the backlight is not bright enough! So we introduced a built-in dual light strip design to make the mirror bright enough. *High Quality* : This Led bathroom mirror uses high-quality light strips to reduce current noise and will be brighter than ordinary light strips. Built-in smart memory function. The brightness mode that works best for you will remain the next time you turn it on. Safe and convenient. *Anti-Fog* : The anti-fog function is individually controlled by a touch switch, which you can turn on or off according to your needs. Safe and energy efficient. Let you have a clear mirror anytime, anywhere. *Adjustable Brightness* : Smart vanity mirrors can adjust the color (warm, natural and white) and brightness of the lights.Suitable for hotels, high-end salons or bedrooms and bathrooms at home. *Waterproof and ShatterProof Package*: Each mirror has a professional anti-collision waterproof packaging to reduce damage during shipping. The waterproof level of the bottom box is IP65, so it is safe to use in wet environments.With epoxy coat, this mirror is corrosion proof. It will not get corroded after 30days acid test. *Easy To Install* : First, draw a straight line with a ruler to keep the mirror horizontal. Second, drill 2 holes or 4 holes according to screws you received. Screw the mirror bracket to the wall and hang the mirror on the bracket.Brackets and screws are included in the package. *Support* : All of ISKM Mirror are covered with 30-Days Money Back if you are not satisfied with the product, 1 year warranty, 3nd year warranty extension and lifetime expert tech support. Please don't hesitate to contact us if there is any question, we will reply to you within 24 hours and help you solve the problems. ISKM customer support team is always just one-email away. [Note]-- The four corners of tempered glass require specific protection! The reason why tempered glass is strong is because the surface has pressure, so the mirror surface will not be damaged by any knocking. However, if the four corners are hit by a hard object, it will be damaged by uneven force. Please protect the four corners when installing.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81VrSEorpqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ISKM","source_asin":"B0BG8H4MS9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-391605","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BG8H4MS9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BG8H4MS9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
