window.products.push({"id":391851,"name":"Jane - Rod Pocket Semi-Sheer Curtains - 2 Pieces - Total Size 108\" W x 63\" L - Natural Light Flow Material Durable - for Bedroom - Living Room - Kid's","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81dqWbtT0aL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Give Elegant Look to Any Room with LinenZone rod pocket Semi Sheer Curtains A quality curtain can make a real difference in any room. It is the central decoration and controls lighting. We are sure our 2-panel sheer curtains will make a difference in your room. Our curtains feature has 1-inch header, 2-inch bottom hem and 1-inch side hem. The rod pockets have of 2.5-inch openings. Long Lasting Style Our stylish curtains will provide a decoration that will really bring any room together. Unlike cheap, easily damaged curtains though, our curtains are made of 100% sturdy polyester material. Their durability promises they will deliver elegance to your rooms for a long time indeed! Beautiful Lighting, No Compromises Unless you enjoy a moody, dark room, a curtain is a compromise between privacy and lighting. Our sheer curtains are designed with a balanced degree of thickness and transparency. They will allow natural light to fill a room, without allowing onlookers a view into your home. Enjoy beautifully lit rooms in a natural ambience. Precise Coverage, Easy Cleaning Their rod pocket design allows for a great appearance>, whether folded or stretched. When it is time to wash them, you can save time and safely place them in the washing machine. Their material guarantees they will stay undamaged, and they will soon be refreshed and back to their rightful place by your window! Do not Miss Out on These Elegant Curtains, Click Add to Cart Now!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81dqWbtT0aL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LinenZone","source_asin":"B0BT8JVL6N","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-391851","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BT8JVL6N","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BT8JVL6N","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":391852,"name":"Robot Birthday Party Supplies Set Plates Napkins Cups Tableware Kit for 16","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.25,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91eCHqkemKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"PREMIUM DESIGN - Our Robot Themed Party Supplies are suitable for girl’s and boy’s birthday parties, holiday celebrations with your family and friends, special events or for just fun-filled daily meals, snacks, and desserts with picnics and cookouts. Shrieks of joy will be your reward when you use these fun and unique party tableware sets. DURABLE AND HIGH QUALITY - Brightly colored matte laminate designs help to prevent saturation. Birthday Galore party plates and cups are made from the highest-quality card stock giving superior durability for cake, ice cream, and more. Cups are reinforced with polyethylene coating to prevent leaks and give added rigidity while tightly rolled rims offer comfortable sipping. If any foods or beverages spill or drip, you can count on our hardy 2-ply napkins for quick clean up. WHAT’S INCLUDED IN PACKAGE – Our party pack serves up to 16 guests. The pack includes 16 dessert plates that are 7 inches, 16 napkins that are 6.5 inches, and 16 cups that hold 9 ounces of beverage. MORE TIME TO ENJOY – Our party tableware can be arranged creatively on your cake table to enhance your party decorations and make a stunning photo backdrop. Tableware is disposable for easy clean up. When the party ends simply dispose of everything and then relax. ECO-FRIENDLY – Birthday Galore paper plates, paper cups, and napkins are food safe, made of 100% food grade material. They are also biodegradable and recyclable.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91eCHqkemKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Birthday Galore","source_asin":"B01EKCKBZ2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-391852","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01EKCKBZ2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01EKCKBZ2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":391853,"name":"Northlight 20\" Pink Glittered Mini Christmas Tree Skirt with White Fur Trim","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":21.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ZYlf14B3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This delightful tree skirt features a dazzling display of pink sequins and shimmering glitter, creating a captivating focal point for your Christmas tree. The skirt is elegantly adorned with white faux fur trim, adding a cozy and festive touch to your seasonal setup. With its compact size, this mini tree skirt is perfect for smaller trees or as a charming accent for tabletop displays. Product Features:. Pink mini Christmas tree skirt. Holographic sequin and glitter base. White faux fur trim with mesh lining. Includes 2 hook and loop fasteners. Round shaped, one-sided design. Perfect for small Christmas trees, mantle displays, holiday table displays, centerpieces, and more!. Recommended for indoor use only. Care instructions: spot clean only Dimensions: 20\" diameter. Material(s): polyester","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ZYlf14B3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Northlight","source_asin":"B09MQYHD7B","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-391853","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09MQYHD7B","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09MQYHD7B","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
