window.products.push({"id":391861,"name":"GezyUS Bathtub Shower Stickers","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51nlq1L7+ML._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Kindly Notes: 1.Do NOT use on surfaces that is dirty, oily, uneven, rugged, rough, dusty, grimy, sandy, muddy, wet, watery. This tape is not meant for under water use or water submersion. Used for clean, dry, flat, and smooth such as: tile, marble, wood, flooring, plastic, glass, metal and more.  2.Our non-slip tape is designed to be 100% weatherproof. Apply it to a clean, dry surface and it will withstand everything from rain, the scorching sun, to snow. And with every 2” grip tape roll being an extra long 33 feet, you’ll have enough to secure everything from your wooden deck, concrete garden steps, tile flooring, or even your little one’s scooter to give them enhanced grip as they scoot away.  3.This tape is a single roll of 2” x 33 Feet. Our item is also known as Anti-Slip Tape, Non-skid Tape, Nonskid Tape, Safety Walk Tape, Skid Resistant Tape, Stair Tape, Step Tape, Sure Step Tape, Step Tread Tape, Safety Tape, Colored Non Skid Tape, Color Non-Skid Tape.  4.Others opt for lower quality adhesives that easily cause the anti-skid tape to peel up, we use high-quality silicone. Not only does it keep the grit tape firmly in place but it also never damages your surfaces or leaves any residue behind if you ever decide to remove it. Save yourself the hassle of replacements and repairs with a grip tape roll that takes the premium approach. Easy to Install 1.Clean surface Clean the surface with a cloth to make the surface clean and dry.  2.Measure and cut Measure the appropriate length and see the cut， (if there is no tool around, you can directly tear it by hand)  3.Paste Place the tape in the desired position for bonding.  4.Fixed Fix the tape on the surface to ensure no gaps and the surface is completely firm.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51nlq1L7+ML._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GezyUS","source_asin":"B07LF6MKLT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-391861","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07LF6MKLT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07LF6MKLT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
