window.products.push({"id":391929,"name":"Rerii Bookcase, 5 Tier Small Bookshelf Kids Open Shelves, Standing Book Storage Case Shelf Display Rack Table for Bathroom Living Room Bedroom Office,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":59.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71+OMAXCevL._AC_SL1100_.jpg","description":"This bookcase is nice for your kids toys and book storage. It made of PVC material. The advantages are waterproof and Eco-friendly. Compared with the solid wood, it is light weight and soft. It makes this bookshelf much safer for your kids use. Also, you can use the small bookcase as your bathroom storage shelf. Because it is waterproof material. It can keep your bathroom clean and tidy. This bookshelf is a nice choice. If it is dirty, you can just clean with soft clothes or directly with water. It will not influence the service life. And it can organize your bathroom stuffs well. It can storage many stuffs. It will be your nice bathroom organizer stand. This small bookshelf is also can be a bookcase end table nightstand for bedroom and living room is good choice too. The height is 35inchs and 3 tier design. You can put your books, cellphone, clock, watch or other stuffs to this shelf. You can take them very conveniently. It is white, it can match your bed and bedroom furniture well. And it is easy to move it to anyplace you want. The size of the small bookcase is 15(L) x 9.5(W) x 35(H) inches. You can see it can fit many places, such as bedroom, living room, bathroom, kitchen and office. And it can do the job well too. This display rack shelf is a very convenient, nice load-bearing, moisture-resistant, environmentally friendly, and easy assembly. The installation of this bookshelf is easy. It is tenon and mortise design. It is just as big building blocks. With your help, you kids can install it too. There is manual inner the package. Just follow and install it one step by step. You will find it is an easy job to install this bookshelf. And you and your kids can gain the installation interesting from it.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71+OMAXCevL._AC_SL1100_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Rerii","source_asin":"B08BZ4XKW1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-391929","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08BZ4XKW1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08BZ4XKW1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
