window.products.push({"id":391997,"name":"KAMANINA 1 Inch Double Curtain Rods 36 to 72 Inches (3-6 Feet) Telescoping Drapery Rod for Windows 24 to 68 Inches, Netted Texture Finials, Black","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":36.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61j3cIw-MZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"TELESCOPING DOUBLE CURTAIN RODS - KAMANINA decorative curtain rod can extend from 36 to 72 inches easily to fit windows size from 24 to 68 inches, and support light to heavy weight curtains. Ideal for kitchen, bedroom, living room, nursery room, office or any other places. THICKER & DURABLE & STURDY - Drapery rods with 0.6mm thickness are made of high-quality metal. 1-Inch diameter on front rod and 3/4-Inch diameter on back rod, features a strong weight capacity, more durable and sturdier than others weak rod. Hold weight up to 30lb. ATTRACTIVE ELEGANT STYLE - Unique netted texture finial on the frond rod end and classic ball finials on the back rod end, add elegant to your windows and decorate home perfectly. Double rods constructions creates a layered look, great for grommet, back tab, rod pocket and tab top curtains. MORE OPTIONS & EASY TO INSTALL - 2 sizes and 5 colors are available to meet your different needs. The rod set packed with 1 set of front rod(2pcs rods), 1 set of back rod(2pcs rods), 2 sets of two finials in black and all mounting hardware for easy installation, including double brackets, screws, drywall anchors and instructions. GUARANTEED SERVICE - You are guaranteed with our 100% satisfaction customer-care program backed by fast and friendly service. Use our window treatment products every day, every penny you spend on KAMANINA is worthy and risk-free. For a better shopping experience, please be sure to buy the NEW ITEM sold by KAMANINA, and say NO to the cheap but no quality assurance USED ITEMS.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61j3cIw-MZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KAMANINA","source_asin":"B09P56PB9M","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-391997","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09P56PB9M","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09P56PB9M","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":391998,"name":"Reliable-E Large Luminous Wall Clock Modern Design Living Room 3D DIY Creative Wall Clocks with Night Light Function for Wall Décor Glow in The Dark W","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81a57oePBkL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Are you bored with the blank wall of your room?  Are you tired of not seeing the number on the clock at night? This Simple 3D DIY Large Lumonius Wall Clock will add a modern twist to your living room, bedroom or office.It is also a best gift for your families, colleagues, friends! Specifications: Material: Acrylic, Alloy clock face, EVA foam stickers Sticker Material: EVA Foam (Ethylene vinyl acetate) Clock Material: Metal, EVA, Plastic Hour Hand: 31.5cm /12.4\" Minute Hand: 39cm / 15.3 Clock Machine: 12cm/ 4.9\" Battery:1.5V AA battery 1 piece(without) The minimum achieving is: 63cm x 63cm / 24.8\" x 24.8\". Montage size:135X135CM The clock final decoration size is decided by how you want to decorate you walls. How to install? Step 1: Use a hammer to knock the nail into wall, then hang clock tray on the wall Step 2: Hang the paper scale on the clock tray, according to the scale to mark numbers’ position Step 3: Remove the paper from back of acrylic mirrors, then fit with matching EVA Step 4: Remove the back paper of EVA; stick to the wall Step 5: Tear off the protective films from mirrors Step 6: Fix the hour hand and minute hand one by one along the 12 o’clock position Step 7: Tighten the nut Step 8: Install a carbon AA battery for clock, adjust the time with gear button of quartz Step 9: Hanging the clock return to wall. Well done! You can enjoy your art-work now Note Pls: There is a protective film on surface of mirror. It may looks with scratches. But the scratches are just on the protective film, the mirrors are still in good condition. Please tear off after installation! Package Included: 1 x DIY Wall Clock Kit Our Service: We offer customers a guarantee of 30 days money back and 2 Years warranty from date of purchase, If the product has any problems, you can get a free replacement without a return.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81a57oePBkL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Reliable-E","source_asin":"B08BZLT8K8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-391998","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08BZLT8K8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08BZLT8K8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":391999,"name":"Greenline Goods Scorpio Stemless Wine Glasses Zodiac Scorpio Set Hand Etched 15 oz (Set of 2) - Astrology Sign Glassware","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81xU33nKikL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"What’s your sign? Each astrology tumbler prominently features the Scorpio constellation, and includes the names of all the associated stars. Rotate the glass and you’ll notice each of the original 11 zodiac signs. Absolutely ideal for horoscope lovers! Flip the glass over, and you’ll see the unique zodiac symbol! Premium quality crystal glass – To bring you something truly special, we chose to etch on extra clear, high quality crystal glass. Stemless wine glasses are also sturdier and less likely to break than traditional stemmed glasses. Unique astrological gift idea: Looking for unique astrology decor or zodiac related gift idea? You found it. Each Greenline Goods wine glass was etched by a skilled artisan and certain to delight the recipient. Glass sets are carefully packed in an elegant gift box and chosen to make a lasting impression! Dishwasher safe & guaranteed for life: Each stemless glass has been sand etched to maintain the integrity of the design. Will not wash off or get distorted in the dishwasher. Glasses have also been thoroughly tested to be breakage resistant. Glassware guarantee: We know you are going to love these glasses, but in case you don’t, each set comes with a 100% Money Back Guarantee.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81xU33nKikL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Greenline Goods","source_asin":"B083GZYRFH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-391999","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B083GZYRFH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B083GZYRFH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
